WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.267
An accepted batch is persisted before settlement effects.

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:04.199
A worker exits before commit; partial effects roll back.

00:00:04.199 --> 00:00:05.980
New workers recover the accepted jobs and settle once.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.988
The observer commits, then loses its delivery acknowledgement.

00:00:07.988 --> 00:00:09.881
Duplicate delivery is ignored by the durable inbox.

00:00:09.881 --> 00:00:11.988
A funding shortage remains visible for checker review.

00:00:11.988 --> 00:00:13.488
Explicit funding and reviewed requeue recover generation two.

